# The caller tells the node which guest index is being handled now.
int32 guest_index
---
# The service reports whether target resolution completed successfully.
bool success
# The service also returns a short human-readable status message.
string message
# The service returns the ordered list of profile ids to introduce the guest to.
string[] target_profile_ids
# The service returns the main profile id the robot should face before speaking.
string face_target_profile_id
# The service returns the main pose the robot should face before speaking.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped face_target_pose
